{"id":"c6dd3bfc0bc402ea","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-KF-plus.md","title":"KF+变体理论","display":"df-KF-plus — KF+变体理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-KF-plus","aliases":["91-df-KF-plus","91-df-KF-variant"],"display":"df-KF-plus — KF+变体理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-truth-consistency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-KF-plus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-KF-plus</span><span>91-df-KF-variant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-KF-plus — KF+变体理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb5e07d472a8bf03\" href=\"?note=fb5e07d472a8bf03\" title=\"91-df-truth-consistency\">91-df-truth-consistency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-KF-plus-—-KF+变体理论-$\\mathrm{KF}^+$\">df-KF-plus — KF+变体理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}^+\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}^+\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (Kripke-Feferman理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}\\)</span> (句子否定的编码函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> (经典一阶逻辑的演绎闭包)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CONS}\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\n\\rightarrow\\neg(T(x)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(x)))\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CONS}\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\n\\rightarrow\\neg(T(x)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(x)))\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}KF\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KF}^+\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{KF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CONS}\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}KF\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KF}^+\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{KF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CONS}\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}^+\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}^+\\)</span> : KF+变体理论</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CONS}\">\\(\\mathrm{CONS}\\)</span>：排除某句及其否定同时为真的真值过剩</li>\n</ul>\n<p>KF+的含义：\n此处采用文献中常见的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}\\)</span> 记法。真理迭代双条件已经属于标准 KF，不应再次作为 KF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^+\">\\(^+\\)</span> 的新增公理。</p>\n<p>KF vs KF+的对比：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公理</th>\n<th>KF</th>\n<th>KF+</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>真理迭代</td>\n<td>已有</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过剩</td>\n<td>未由基本 KF 排除</td>\n<td>由 CONS 排除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预期模型</td>\n<td>可含过剩的闭合模型</td>\n<td>一致强 Kleene 固定点模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>KF+的特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CONS 只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\neg\\varphi)\\to\\neg T(\\varphi)\">\\(T(\\neg\\varphi)\\to\\neg T(\\varphi)\\)</span>；其逆向是排除间隙的 COMP，不能混同</li>\n<li>KF 与 KF<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^+\">\\(^+\\)</span> 的对象背景逻辑都为经典</li>\n<li>在一致的 Kripke 固定点解释下 CONS 成立</li>\n</ul>\n<p>KF+的证明能力：\n新增公理使理论包含关系增强，但是否严格增加算术后果须由独立证明论结果确定，不能由定义直接写成序数严格不等式。</p>\n<p>KF+的限制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CONS 正是用来排除“双重值”而不是制造它</li>\n<li>它仍允许句子与其否定都不真，即真值间隙</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-KF-plus-—-KF+变体理论-$\\mathrm{KF}^+$","text":"df-KF-plus — KF+变体理论 $\\mathrm{KF}^+$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"fb5e07d472a8bf03","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KF}$ (Kripke-Feferman理论, see [[91-df-KF]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CONS}\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\n\\rightarrow\\neg(T(x)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(x)))\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}KF\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KF}^+\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{KF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CONS}\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CONS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}","display":false},{"tex":"^+","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\neg\\varphi)\\to\\neg T(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"^+","display":false}],"bytes":1972,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-KF-plus]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-KF-plus]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df